  entertainment\, cultural performances and demonstrations\, food and bever
 ages\, artists\, makers and marketplace vendors\, wellness and community o
 rganizations\, and interactive activities for children and teens. Festival
 goers can also experience the Under Many Moons art exhibit and connect wit
 h the diverse people\, traditions\, and stories that make the North Bay vi
 brant. Many Moons Festival takes place Saturday\, October 3\, 2026\, from 
 11:00 a.m. to 7:00 p.m. at Ives Park in Sebastopol\, California. Advance t
 ickets are $10\; admission is $15 at the gate\; children 12 and under atte
 nd free. For the latest schedule\, ticket information\, transportation det
 ails\, accessibility information\, and festival updates\, visit manymoonsf
 estival.com.
