BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hallberg Butterfly Gardens Fall Plant Sale & Fundraiser
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T160000
UID:260922JJSTYXo2DEWEri_izPYllw
DESCRIPTION:Hallberg Butterfly Gardens’ Fall Native Plant Sale & Fundrai
 ser is coming up October 2nd & 3rd\, from 9:00 am–4:00 pm!\n\nOur nurser
 y focuses on California native plants that support local wildlife and poll
 inators—especially butterflies and moths. Whether you’re adding a few 
 natives to your garden\, creating a backyard wildlife habitat\, or looking
  for host and nectar plants\, we’ll have a wide variety to choose from.\
 n\nFall is an excellent time to plant California native plants.  This yea
 r’s sale will include red-flowering currant\, seaside daisy\, Douglas ir
 is\, Dutchman’s pipevine\, western azalea\, blue elderberry\, tiger lily
 \, hedgerow plants\, and much more.\n\nPlant lists organized by bloom time
  and butterfly and moth host plants will be available at the sale\, and ou
 r knowledgeable staff will be on hand to help answer questions and help yo
 u choose plants for your garden.\n\nBecause parking at Hallberg Butterfly 
 Gardens is limited\, the plant sale is by appointment.\n\nReserve a time a
 nd view the complete plant list on our website: https://hallbergbutterflyg
 ardens.org/our-nursery\n\nAfter your nursery appointment\, you’re welcom
 e to stay and enjoy a self-guided walk through the Gardens.\n\nYour plant 
 purchases support Hallberg Butterfly Gardens and our work creating and car
 ing for habitat for butterflies\, moths\, pollinators\, and other local wi
 ldlife.\n\nWe hope to see you at the Gardens!
LOCATION:Hallberg Butterfly Gardens
URL:https://hallbergbutterflygardens.org/our-nursery
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:1TRIBE: Reggae • Dancehall • Afrobeats • Amapiano with Konne
 x & Kobie
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T013000
UID:26092258t7u5lkm02CWuRi3iWWTg
DESCRIPTION:1TRIBE: Reggae • Dancehall • Afrobeats • Amapiano with K
 onnex & Kobie\n\n1TRIBE returns to Barrel Proof Lounge for another night o
 f Reggae\, Dancehall\, Afrobeats & Amapiano in Downtown Santa Rosa.\n\nKon
 nex Productions and Barrel Proof Lounge bring 1TRIBE back on Saturday\, Oc
 tober 3\, turning the lounge into a late-night dance floor powered by soun
 ds from Africa\, the Caribbean and across the global club scene.\n\nBehind
  the decks are DJ Konnex & DJ Kobie\, two selectors with deep roots in the
  music and a serious range between them.\n\nDJ KONNEX Voted 2025 NorBay Be
 st Live DJ\, Santa Rosa's Konnex has built a reputation for sets that move
  fluidly across reggae\, dancehall\, Afrobeats and global club sounds. Rat
 her than simply jumping from track to track\, his sets are built as a jour
 ney — digging deep\, changing gears and keeping the dance floor moving.\
 n\nDJ KOBIE Born in Trinidad & Tobago and now based in the Bay Area\, Kobi
 e Quashie brings an international sound-system pedigree to 1TRIBE. He foun
 ded Ashanti Hi Fi SoundSystem and has performed across California and arou
 nd the world\, including Trinidad\, Jamaica\, Brazil\, Mexico\, South Afri
 ca and Ethiopia. His musical range reaches through reggae\, dancehall\, Af
 robeat\, Afro House\, Soca\, hip-hop and electronic music\, while keeping 
 Caribbean sound-system culture at the heart of the mix.\n\nTogether\, Konn
 ex and Kobie created 1TRIBE around a simple idea: African rhythm\, Caribbe
 an energy and global dance music sharing the same room. Afrobeats rolls in
 to Amapiano. Reggae gives way to Dancehall. The tempo changes\, the bass s
 tays heavy\, and the dance floor connects it all.\n\nIf you caught 1TRIBE 
 at Barrel Proof in June\, you already know the energy. Now the tribe gathe
 rs again.\n\n1TRIBE  Reggae • Dancehall • Afrobeats • Amapiano\n\nL
 IMITED RESERVED TABLES\n\nWant a home base for the night? We have just 12 
 reserved tables available for $69 each.\n\nEach table includes:\n\nReserve
 d seating for 4 Your own call button for beverage service A guaranteed spo
 t to sit down between trips to the dance floor\n\nOnly 12 tables are avail
 able\, so grab yours in advance if you want one.\n\n Saturday\, October 3
 \, 2026  9 PM  Barrel Proof Lounge — Downtown Santa Rosa  Konnex & Ko
 bie  $10 Presale  21+\n\nCome early. Stay late. Find your rhythm.\n\nBar
 rel Proof Lounge 501 Mendocino Ave Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nCheck out **www.
 BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://1TribeOctober.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
