DESCRIPTION:Chocolatier Sarah Cain of Spirited Sweets Chocolates is proud 
 to announce her upcoming Haunted Chocolate Cottage Workshop\, hosted at An
 chor Pantry. This is the first of her hands-on seasonal sessions to help h
 oliday enthusiasts and dessert lovers learn the art of edible architecture
