DESCRIPTION:Cuban Salsa Intermediate\n\nOctober 3 – October 24 \\(4-week
 \\) no class October 10\n\n1:00 pm – 2:00 pm\n\nTake your dancing to the
  next level in this focused\, high-energy intensive! Designed for dancers 
 who already know the fundamentals. Cuban salsa Intermediate class will mov
 e beyond basic steps to focus on complex partner work patterns\, advanced 
 body styling\, dynamic musicality\, and the authentic flow of Cuban Casino
 .\n\n• 4-week course\, Saturdays\n\n• Date: October 3 – October 24 \
 \(4-week\\) no class October 10\n\n• Time: 1:00 pm – 2:00 pm\n\n• Lo
 cation: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8\, San Rafael\, CA\n\n• Registration No
 te: This class requires a minimum of 8 registrations to run. Please regist
 er early so we can secure the session! Please no walk-ins\n\nPrerequisites
 \n\nTo ensure a fluid\, fast-paced learning environment\, this is an Inter
 mediate level\n\n• Requirement: You must have completed a Beginner Cuban
  Salsa course or have a solid grasp of beginner fundamentals \\(including 
 basic footwork\, timing\, standard left/right turns\, and fundamental part
 ner connection\\).\n\nWhat We Will Cover\n\n• Advanced Partnerwork: Intr
 icate Cuban Casino patterns\, seamless transitions\, and directional chang
 es.\n\n• Styling & Body Movement: Incorporating authentic Cuban body iso
 lation and natural expression into your dancing.\n\n• Musicality & Conne
 ction: Refining lead/follow mechanics to hit musical breaks and accents na
 turally.\n\n• Intensive Structure: We will kick off with a quick body is
 olation warm-up and advanced footwork exercises before diving straight int
 o partnerwork technique and practical\, social-ready combinations.\n\nCome
  dance with us\, elevate your technique\, and experience the energy and fl
 avor of Cuba in a supportive and welcoming environment!\n\nImportant Detai
 ls\n\n• Arrival: Please arrive 10 minutes before class starts to check i
 n.\n\n• Shoe Policy: No floor-marking shoe soles allowed on the dance fl
 oor.\n\n• 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8\, San Rafael\, CA\n\n• October 3 
 – October 24 \\(4-week\\) no class October 10\n\n• 1:00 pm. – 2:00 p
 m
