DESCRIPTION:Join us on October 3\, 2026 for the Ripp’n River Bash\, 
 a signature fundraising celebration in support of Russian Riverkeeper—br
 inging together neighbors\, environmental champions\, and local leaders fo
 r one extraordinary night dedicated to protecting the Russian River.  \n
 \n**Evening Highlights:** Cocktails & Appeitizers in the Grange Courtyard\
 n\nCharlie Palmer - Inspired Dinner Experience\n\n**Parking:**  Self-par
 king and complimentary valet service will be available.\n\n$475.00 per per
 son (see ticket link for other options)\n\nYou can also mail a check to th
 e address below. Please include your name\, guest names. and number of tic
 kets.\n\nRussian Riverkeeper P.O. Box 1335 Healdsburg\, CA 95448 info@russ
