DESCRIPTION:DonGato Band is a group of seasoned musicians that loves the 
 perfect combination of great music\, great time and entertaining an exciti
 ng audience. If you are looking for something different for the next compa
 ny party\, need to liven up your corporate event with a live show? The Don
 Gato Band has you covered. We are available for large\, medium and small e
 vents including\; company dinners\, conventions\, holiday parties\, trade 
 shows and launch events. Impress your guests with a live Latin band! We pl
 ay Salsa\, Cuban Son\, Cumbias\, Cha Cha Cha\, Smooth Latin Jazz and many 
 other sophisticated Latin rhythms.  Our full ensemble can fill ballrooms\
 , reception halls\, outdoor venues and more intimate dining rooms with a v
 ariety of latin music. We specialize in bringing people to their feet and 
 energizing the crowd for an unforgettable event!\n\nFood: Tacos Y Pupusas 
 La Bendicion will be serving up authentic Mexican & Salvadorian cuisine wi
 th the best pupusas in the area\, tacos\, burritos\, salads\, quesadillas\
 , and so much more! \n\nCome join us for our Salsa Sunday Series!
LOCATION:Vino Godfather
URL:https://events.vinogodfather.com/don-gato/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
