DESCRIPTION:Learn to play Chinese \\(Hong Kong-style\\) mahjong\, or come 
 play with friends if you already know the game! We will have sets and inst
 ructors on site to teach the game and help with rules and scoring. Mahjong
  is a game for multi-generations\; it keeps the mind sharp with a basic se
 t of rules that can be learned in 30 minutes\, and adds unending ways to a
 dd strategy and challenge\; it builds community and sustains culture\; it'
 s fun and addicting in a wholesome way! 'Four Flowers Mahjong Salon' goal 
 is to bring mahjong to the Sonoma County area. They currently teach at pri
 vate homes\, farmers markets\, tasting rooms\, and coffee shops!
