UID:260915A8yc7uh6TU-Po449d93cuw
DESCRIPTION:Directions: Meet at the Limantour Beach parking area. From Hwy
  101 in Larkspur\, take the exit for Sir Francis Drake Blvd west 20.4 mile
 s to Olema. Turn right onto Hwy 1. Go 500 feet\, turn left onto Bear Valle
 y Rd go 0.5 miles\, turn left onto Limantour Rd\, 7.5 miles to par king ar
 ea.\n\nSponsor: Parks\n\nAccommodation Information: If you are a person wi
 th a disability and require an accommodation to participate in a County pr
 ogram\, service\, or activity\, requests may be made by calli ng 415-473-4
 381 \\(Voice\\)\, Dial 711 for CA Relay \, or by submitting a\n\nDisabilit
 y Accommodation Request\n\nat least five business days in advance of the e
 vent. We will do our best to fulfill requests received with less than five
  business days' notice. Copies of documents are available in alternative f
 ormats upon request.\n\nEvery year a multitude of birds move through the o
 uter areas of the county during the fall migration. We'll explore the estu
 a ry\, beach\, and open water looking for birds that stop here as they mak
  e their way from northern breeding grounds to their winter homes in the s
 outh. Total miles: 3. There is little elevation change\, but we w ill be w
 alking in sand\, including one short climb over the dunes. This walk is of
 fered in partnership with Point Reyes National Seashore. Remember to bring
  lunch\, and binoculars if you have them. No pets are allowed\, except for
  service/companion animals. Adverse weather or poor air quality may cancel
 . Registration is required.\n\nQuestions: Contact\n\nshannon.burke%40marin
 county.gov\n\nShannon Burke
LOCATION:Point Reyes National Seashore
URL:https://www.marincounty.gov/county-marin-calendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
