SUMMARY:Appetizers & Dinner Party Themes with Erin Shallat
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T113000
UID:260928jxv10RzHFku7-qfBMtsf2Q
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, September 30\, 2026 10:00 am to 11:30 am\n\nWeekly
  on Wednesdays\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 109\, Rotary Kitchen\n\nCategory\n\nCul
 inary Arts\, Wellness\n\nExperience Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n18 and 
 older\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$15\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\nIncluded\n\nTotal 
 Registration Cost:\n\n$15\n\nAs the founder of Erin Shallat Catering in Sa
 n Francisco\, Erin brings over two decades of experience in transforming n
 utrition into an art form. Her unique approach intertwines advanced studie
 s in nutrition with a deep passion for the culinary arts. Erin’s goal is
  to make meal prep approachable and not intimidating for everyone\, encour
 aging students to gain confidence in the kitchen. She believes in working 
 with seasonal produce and what’s available\, helping students learn to c
 reate health-conscious yet tantalizing menus that embrace both flavor and 
 wellness. Introducing our Fall/Winter Cooking Series—designed for both r
 eturning and new students. This six-week program runs Mondays and Wednesda
 ys\, each with a unique focus to offer variety\, skill-building\, and fun 
 throughout the season.Wednesdays are all about creativity and fun! Each we
 ek features a new theme centered on easy appetizers and dinner party dishe
 s. From festive bites to crowd-pleasers\, these sessions will inspire stud
 ents to host gatherings or simply enjoy something new on their own.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/appetizers-dinner-party-the
 mes-with-erin-shallat/2026-09-30/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
