DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T221500
UID:260915vJn5yLTtS0yI4YpP7hjXww
DESCRIPTION:*Emilia* by Morgan Lloyd Malcolm is a passionate\, feminist r
 eimagining of the life of 17th-century poet and musician Emilia Bassano. T
 he play\, performed by an all-female cast\, delves into her journey from a
  privileged childhood\, to becoming a trailblazing poet\, and a woman figh
 ting for her say in a male-dominated world.
LOCATION:SRJC Burbank Auditorium
