DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T193000
UID:260915iI5b6ZwGTUmPoz65Iak_6g
DESCRIPTION:On Thursday\, October 8 at 6pm\, The Madrona\, the two-MICHELI
 N Key boutique hotel and restaurant in Healdsburg\, will debut the inaugur
 al Madrona Garden Supper Club\, a new dining series celebrating the beauty
 \, abundance and changing seasons of the historic estate’s garden.\n\nDe
 signed as an intimate dinner party of just 30 guests\, The Madrona Garden 
 Supper Club offers a firsthand look at the property’s onsite regenerativ
 e gardens and how they drive the culinary program and seasonal menus. The 
 experience begins in the Citrus Grove with welcome cocktails \\(or spirit-
 free alternatives\\) and seasonal canapés\, followed by a chef-guided wal
 k through The Madrona’s garden to explore the harvested ingredients insp
 iring the night’s menu. Guests will then sit down along Garden Lane for 
 a four-course dinner \\(and optional wine pairing\\) inspired entirely by 
 what is growing in the garden at that very moment.\n\nWhat: The Madrona Ga
 rden Supper Club: Autumn\n\nWhen: Thursday\, October 8 at 6pm\n\nWhere: Th
 e Madrona\, 1001 Westside Road\, Healdsburg\n\nPrice: $150 per person with
  optional wine or non-alcoholic pairing \\($65 per person\\)\n\nRSVP: Seat
 s are limited\, so RSVPs through OpenTable are required.\n\nThe Madrona Ga
 rden Supper Club will continue to evolve with the seasons\, with new dates
  in 2027 to be announced and each menu curated around what’s freshest in
  the garden.
LOCATION:The Madrona
URL:https://www.opentable.com/booking/experiences-availability?rid=8088&re
 stref=8088&experienceId=791873&utm_source=external&utm_medium=referral&utm
 _campaign=shared
