BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Public Class: Iconic Moles of Mexico with Chef Luis Realpozo
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T203000
UID:261002S6GRYEEtc0eHBgLYFOMMJQ
DESCRIPTION:Every region of Mexico lays claim to its own celebrated mole 
 — a rich\, complex\, culture-defining sauce that tells the story of its 
 land and people. Crafted from 30 to 50 carefully chosen ingredients\, each
  recipe is a tribute to the chiles\, spices\, and local treasures unique t
 o that region and pueblo. Layers of herbs\, raisins\, plantains\, nuts\, a
 nd the occasional touch of chocolate make every variation a discovery. \n
 \nDemystify the process with Chef Luis Realpozo as he guides you through m
 aking three distinct moles using traditional ingredients and authentic tec
 hniques. Enjoy tasting enchiladas with mole sauce together and gain a whol
 e new appreciation for one of Mexico's enduring culinary treasures.
LOCATION:Homeward Bound Of Marin Community Teaching Kitchen
URL:https://secure.qgiv.com/for/communitykitchenmasterform/event/community
 -class-100926/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
