UID:260929DQ8qiu_0Vke_EZKbYDxbmQ
DESCRIPTION:**H&L Live: The Dans of Steel**\n\nHook & Ladder Live welcomes
  The Dans of Steel — a Bay Area tribute band celebrating the music of St
 eely Dan\, the prolific American rock band founded in 1972 by masterminds 
 Donald Fagen and Walter Becker.\n\nStarted in 2017\, The Dans of Steel bri
 ng together five deeply soulful musicians — Waddell Bell\, Ronnie Smith\
 , Dave Shul\, Malcolm Marshall\, and Raliegh Neal — who explore\, "funka
 fy\," and lovingly recreate songs from throughout the Steely Dan canon\, w
 eaving together jazz\, rock\, and R&B sensibilities.\n\n🍷 **Wine Club P
 erk:** Up to 4 member guests receive a complimentary glass of Chill Red or
  Estate Sauvignon Blanc on arrival.\n\n‍**What to Know:**\n\n**Admission
  is free** - just show up and enjoy\n\n**Food** - fresh brick oven pizza f
 or purchase\n\n**Outdoor seating** - lawn and picnic area available (bring
  blankets encouraged)\n\n**All ages welcome** - family-friendly event\n\n*
 *Wine available** for purchase by the glass or bottle\n\nThis is H&L Live 
 at its best: world-class musicians\, golden hour timing\, and the Russian 
 River Valley as your backdrop. Come early\, stay late\, and experience why
  the North Bay music scene is legendary.
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
URL:https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/hl-live-the-dans-of-steel
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
