 ttps://www.penngrovesocialfiremen.org\n\n POLENTA AND STEW DINNER BENEFIT
 S PENNGROVE PARK AND CLUBHOUSE – Oct. 10\, 2026\n\n Join us for a cozy 
 evening of hearty polenta and stew\, all for a good cause on\n\nSaturday\,
  October 10\, 2026\, at Penngrove Community Clubhouse\, 385 Woodward Aven
 ue\, Penngrove.  \n\n This is a meal that old-time farmers ate\, long 
 before the term 'farm-to-table' was coined. Polenta and stew will be serve
 d with green salad\, French bread\, and dessert.  \n\n Social hour is a
 t 5:30 pm\, with dinner at 6:30 pm. \n\n All proceeds benefit Penngrove 
