DESCRIPTION:The undead will rise for a night of eerie eats\, creepy cockta
 ils\, and bloodcurdling fun at the Santa Rosa Zombie Crawl on Saturday\, O
 ctober 10! Starting at Blind Scream Haunted House between 5–5:30 PM\, zo
 mbies will collect their wristbands and treasure maps before staggering of
 f on a fright-filled adventure.\n\nAlong the way\, crawlers can sip and sn
 ack on ghastly specials from some of the best bars and restaurants Downtow
 n Santa Rosa has to offer.\n\nTo finish off your crawl\, drag your bones b
 ack to Blind Scream Haunted House before 9:30 PM for VIP entry into both h
 aunted houses — including the pitch-dark terror of The Blackout. If you
 ’re still undead after that\, keep the night alive with a nightcap. Part
 icipating establishments will be announced soon.\n\nCostumes are highly en
 couraged… after all\, what’s a crawl without a creepy crowd?\n\nJoin u
 s for a night to dismember!\n\nThis is a 21 years of age or older event.
