UID:260820joRxcxAYzESlakPgLB_BVw
DESCRIPTION:The Spooky Skulls Workshop is a fun\, hands-on experience whe
 re you paint a blank ceramic skull in bright or eerie colors for fall deco
 r\, and create your own skull custom-scented candle to celebrate the spook
 y season at home. \n\nThis is a family friendly workshop\, kids ages 9+ a
 re welcome to participate\, but an adult must be registered too.\n\nOctobe
