SUMMARY:Community Coffee Tasting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T140000
UID:260815E41QNhDG60K0HD1CBnY4JQ
DESCRIPTION:Sample coffee from around the world\, browse crafts and confec
 tions by local vendors\, or enjoy made-to order crêpes while listening to
  live music\, or poetry open mic on the first Saturday of the month..\n\nC
 offee cupping\, or coffee tasting\, is the practice of observing the taste
 s and aromas of brewed coffee. Join us to sample coffees from around the w
 orld side-by-side\, develop your palate and discover coffees you LOVE that
  you never knew existed!
LOCATION:Moschetti Coffee Roaster
URL:https://moschetti.com/community/
