 ragedy. This community event will feature all-you-can-eat pancakes \\(serv
 ed hot off the griddle\\)\, equipment demonstrations\, tours of Fire Stati
 on 56\, fire extinguisher practice for residents\, outreach booths & fire 
 prevention week information\, and  games & giveaways.\n\nThis is a donati
 on-based fundraiser\, no set plate cost. Donations accepted via cash\, che
 ck\, or Venmo \\(@sanrafaelfirefoundation\\). All proceeds benefit the San
  Rafael Fire Foundation \\(https://www.srfirefoundation.org/\\) supporting
  the San Rafael Fire Department and its Firefighters and Paramedics. For e
 vent details and to reserve a spot\, go to https://www.eventbrite.com/e/pa
