BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Golden Hour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T170000
UID:2609032n4M9C-PvEayZI1TQL4ewQ
DESCRIPTION:This September and October\, Lucci Lambrusco is taking over 
 Golden Hour at El Dorado Kitchen\, bringing a taste of Italian aperitivo
  culture to the patio all season long.\n\nSettle in for a late afternoon o
 f Lucci Lambrusco\, Italian wines\, cocktails and shareable bites made for
  lingering. Throughout the two-month takeover\, Lucci will be joined every
  Thursday by a rotating lineup of guest wineries\, importers and producers
 \, each stopping by to pour something special and share a little more abou
 t what’s in your glass.\n\nThe season kicks off on Thursday\, September
  3\, with live music\, Lucci Lambrusco\, passed pizzas and arancini on the
  patio.\n\nLUCCI ITALIAN GOLDEN HOUR TAKEOVER Monday–Friday | 3:00–
 5:00 PM September & October\n\nTHURSDAY GUEST WINE SERIES Every Thursday |
  3:00–5:00 PM\n\nSeptember 3 | Lucci Lambrusco\n\nSeptember 10 | Oliver 
 McCrum Wines\n\nSeptember 17 | Mora Estate\n\nSeptember 24 | Idlewild Wine
 s\n\nOctober 1 | Cline Family Cellars\n\nOctober 8 | Unti Vineyards\n\nOct
 ober 15 | Massican\n\n...and more to come!\n\nLucci is pouring all season 
 long\, with a few friends joining along the way.\n\nCome for a glass. Stay
  for another.\n\nJOIN US FOR GOLDEN HOUR
LOCATION:El Dorado Hotel
URL:https://eldoradosonoma.com/el-dorado-kitchen/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Salsa Intermediate with Steven Khuong (6 Weeks)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T191500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T201500
UID:260902cutsbAyHtEaDabyZXYJ28g
DESCRIPTION:OCTOBER 14 – NOVEMBER 18 \\( 6 weeks\\)\n\n7:15 PM – 8:15 
 PM 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8\, San Rafael\, CA\n\nReady to take your salsa
  to the next level? This 6-week salsa intermediate Marin series is designe
 d for dancers who already know the basics \\(timing\, basic steps\, and si
 mple turns\, etc.\\) and want to build the confidence and versatility to s
 hine on the social dance floor.\n\nIn this class\, you’ll:\n\nDevelop ad
 aptability so you can flow with different partners and music.\n\nRefine yo
 ur footwork and styling for sharper expression.\n\nMaster more complex tur
 n patterns and combinations.\n\nStrengthen your lead and follow for smooth
 er\, more connected dancing.\n\nWhat to Expect: Steven’s teaching style 
 blends structure with fun\, creating a supportive space where you’ll be 
 challenged but never overwhelmed. Each week builds on the last\, helping y
 ou progress steadily while keeping the joy of salsa front and center.\n\nD
 etails:\n\nNo partner necessary — rotations ensure everyone gets to danc
 e.\n\nPlease wear non-marking shoe soles to protect the floor.\n\nArrive
  10 minutes early to warm up and get settled.\n\nDate & Time: Wednesdays @
  7:15PM – 8:15PM\n\nInstructor: Steven Khuong\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood H
 ighway \\#8 San Rafael\, CA
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/intermediate-salsa-wednesday-715-pm/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
