BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Samba no Pé - First Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T193000
UID:260415BguHgec3uUScRl1vMeHqog
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to feel the rhythm and energy of Rio de Janeiro! Sa
 mba no Pé \\(Samba in the Foot\\) is the captivating solo style of samba
  danced in the streets and at Carnival\, known for its rapid\, intricate f
 ootwork and infectious hip movements.\n\nYou will learn\n\nThe Basic Step:
  You will master the signature quick-quick-slow rhythm that defines Samba 
 no Pé.\n\nArm & Hip Styling: You will learn how to add the authentic flai
 r\, movement\, and energy that makes Brazilian samba so captivating.\n\nTe
 chnique & Posture: You will receive tips on proper body alignment to help 
 you dance longer\, faster\, and more safely.\n\nRhythm & Musicality: You w
 ill learn how to connect your movement directly to the irresistible beat o
 f the bateria \\(the samba drum section\\).\n\nThis class is perfect for a
 nyone looking to connect with the vibrant spirit of Brazil\, improve coord
 ination\, and get a fantastic workout—all while learning the foundationa
 l steps of this iconic dance. No partner or prior dance experience is requ
 ired! Just bring your enthusiasm and comfortable shoes!\n\nDate & Time: Th
 ursdays @6:30PM – 7:30PM\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8 San Rafae
 l\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking shoe soles allo
 wed.
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/samba-no-pe
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Evening with the Rush Tribute Project
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T193000
UID:260301yptEXbv9oUOMuC20NdDBHg
DESCRIPTION:Emporium Presents\n\nAn Evening with the Rush Tribute Project\
 n\nThursday\, October 15\, 2026\n\n7:30 pm\n\nBUY TICKETS\n\nThe Rush Trib
 ute Project is an homage to one of the most enduring and influential bands
  in rock music. Combining skilled musicianship with exciting performances\
 , The Rush Tribute Project \\(known as RTP to its dedicated fanbase\\) pai
 nstakingly recreates the sound and energy that made Rush one of the top-se
 lling rock bands of all time. Using vintage instruments\, multi-camera pro
 jection\, state-of-the-art lighting & lasers\, and signature virtuosity\, 
 RTP will be performing two full sets of music\, including Moving Pictures 
 in its entirety\, as well as deep cuts like “La Villa Strangiato” and 
 “Enter Nous.”\n\nHaving performed for more than a decade across North 
 America and around the world\, including RushCon\, RTP stands as one of th
 e premiere tributes to this legendary rock ‘n’ roll power trio.\n\nPla
 tinum Tickets are tickets that are dynamically priced up and down based on
  demand. Platinum Tickets are not part of VIP packages – they are ticket
 s only.\n\nPlatinum Seating provides fans with direct access to securing s
 ome of the best seats in the venue at market value. The market value for P
 latinum Seating is subject to change based on the overall demand and popul
 arity for the event.  Platinum Seating allows fans to purchase tickets in
  a safe and secure environment without running the risk of purchasing tick
 ets that may be considered lost\, stolen\, or counterfeit.\n\nTHIRD PARTY 
 RESELLERS\n\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots 
 to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect
  your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work 
 directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in
  Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily
  accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/rush-tribute-project26/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
