DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T220000
UID:260319FcdbEzvl3EmyYgwx0vTzhA
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of fun and music at Lifted Karaoke hoste
 d by the amazing Rachel Rader! Join us in person at The Lounge at Mercy fo
 r your chance to sing your heart out\, enjoy great vibes\, and make new fr
