DESCRIPTION:ONE LAST GATHERING • CLOSING COCKTAILS\n\nAll things must co
 me to pass—and Maria Isabel Lopez closes this chapter with a heart full 
 of gratitude.\n\nJoin us for one last peek at Lopez’s mosaics\, one last
  evening to celebrate Illumination in Glass\, and the beautiful journey th
 is exhibition has been.\n\nSome pieces have already found their homes\, wh
 ile a few are still waiting for the right home to find them.\n\nCome raise
  a glass with us as Kabayan Wines pours their beautiful wines\, accompanie
 d by live music and good company.\n\nClosing Cocktail Saturday\, October 1
 7 • 5–8 PM Usher Gallery\, Petaluma\n\nCome for the art. Stay for the 
 wine and music. And help us celebrate this chapter before the lights go do
 wn.
