DESCRIPTION:Join Katie Murken as she discusses Steer Clear\, the pinnacle 
 work of her interdisciplinary series Dust to Dust. In this work\, she tran
 sforms discarded materials into a meditation on the environmental crisis a
 nd the silencing of women's voices. Murken will describe her overall proce
 ss of using found materials and documentary-style photography to weave her
  narratives into layered\, interdisciplinary works that defy categorizatio
 n. \n\n \n\n 
