BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Formative Influence Art Exhibit
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T160000
UID:260909-Bb3YIiXxEq8S2Onw9A7fA
DESCRIPTION:Formative Influence explores the transformative power of light
  across five bodies of work. Inspired by the landscapes of Northern Califo
 rnia and the American West\, the exhibition examines the shift from photog
 raphy\, where light is observed and captured\, to painting\, where light i
 s created to shape new visual experiences. Rather than documenting the lan
 dscape\, these works evoke its emotional resonance\, emphasizing atmospher
 e\, memory\, and perception over literal representation.
LOCATION:Marin Center
URL:https://www.marincultural.org/exhibitions
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Haunted Wine Tour & Tasting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T173000
UID:260831mylFrEsSiEeMeHSTG3j-Ng
DESCRIPTION:This fall\, Buena Vista Winery invites you to uncover the myst
 eries\, legends\, and ghostly encounters woven into more than 165 years of
  history. Led by Sonoma historian and actor George Webber\, this immersive
  90 minute experience journeys through the historic Press House and Champa
 gne Cellars\, revealing true tales of unexplained happenings reported by B
 uena Vista team members and visitors throughout the years.\n\nHear the sto
 ries of the Glowing Ghostly Shirt\, the Little Girl Who Says Hi\, the myst
 erious Ghost Party on the Second Floor\, the Old Man Who Walked Into a Sto
 ne Wall\, and other strange occurrences that continue to add to the legend
  of Buena Vista.\n\nAlong the way\, explore some of the winery’s most in
 triguing spaces\, including the Bubble Lounge\, Cave of Curiosities\, and 
 Wine Tool Museum\, while enjoying five Buena Vista wines tasted throughout
  the experience\, including a taste drawn directly from barrel.\n\nAnd\, a
 s with any journey through Buena Vista’s extraordinary past\, you never 
 quite know when the winery’s legendary founder\, Count Agoston Haraszthy
 \, may choose to make an appearance.\n\nHistory\, wine\, mystery\, and per
 haps a spirit or two await.
LOCATION:Buena Vista Historical Winery
URL:https://eventvesta.com/events/160340/t/tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T170000
UID:260824Hwtol3I7WUWVX9AM0ZEgtw
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\nMaple Magic & Winter Wonder invites vis
 itors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativity\
 , and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided walks\,
  hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by the c
 hanging landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the swee
 t fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experience th
 e peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Salsa Beginners 2 - Mondays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T190000
UID:2604276hsnE1022ke0fYsSQi6U7A
DESCRIPTION:Ready to take your salsa to the next level? Salsa lessons in M
 arin will help you to add some flair and fluidity to your salsa dancing.\n
 \nPre-requisite: Salsa Beginners 1 – You know your basic steps\, left tu
 rn\, right turn\, cross-body lead\, and you hold your frame.\n\nWhat You
 ’ll Learn\n\nWe’ve curated a curriculum designed to build your confide
 nce and your “social dance” vocabulary:\n\n• The Cross Body Lead \\(
 CBL\\) Series: Master both Inside and Outside Turns\, the essential buildi
 ng blocks for moving your partner across the floor with grace.\n\n• The 
 “I Turn – You Turn”: A classic social dance staple that develops tim
 ing and hand-change coordination.\n\n• The Walk-Through: Learn how to tr
 ansition smoothly through the dance space without breaking your rhythm.\n\
 n• Footwork & Shine: We’ll break down the footwork pattern that adds p
 ersonality to your “shines.”\n\nTechnique & Artistry\n\n• Dancing is
  about more than just where your feet go. In this level\, we dive deeper i
 nto the “how”:\n\n• The Frame: Understand the “tension and compres
 sion” needed to lead and follow clearly without using muscle.\n\n• Upp
 er Body Mechanics: Learn how to isolate your ribcage and shoulders to move
  with that authentic Latin soul.\n\n• Connection: Developing a “heavy
 ” but responsive arm connection to ensure your partner feels every lead.
 \n\nImportant Details\n\n• No dance experience required: Whether you’v
 e never danced before or it’s been a while\, you’re welcome here!\n\n
 • No partner necessary: Come solo or bring a friend—either way\, you
 ’ll have plenty of opportunities to dance.\n\n• Please wear non-markin
 g shoe soles: This helps us keep our dance floor in great condition.\n\nDa
 te & Time:\n\nMonday 6:00 PM\n\nSaturday 11:00 AM\n\nInstructor: Lucie Ebn
 erova\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8 San Rafael\, CA \\(salsa lesso
 ns in Marin\\)\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking shoe so
 les allowed.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-beginners-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Move N Groove
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T170000
UID:260319Wq1lUHAoOkev3Pa9hSnVhg
DESCRIPTION:Find Your Rhythm with James Darling Looking for a fun way to 
 stay active? Join James for a fun dance session designed for everyone. We
 ’re turning up the volume on the world’s biggest pop hits—come expre
 ss yourself and leave it all on the floor!\n\nNo stress: Every song uses 
 repetitive moves so you’ll be a pro by the final chorus.\n\nGet confiden
 t: We rotate the same playlist all month long\, giving you plenty of time
  to master the groove.\n\nJoin the party!\n\nAt Move N Groove\, we care m
 ore about your smile than your footwork. This isn’t just a cardio dance 
 class\; it’s a high-energy trip through musical theater\, world beats\, 
 and your favorite hits from every decade.\n\nCome sweat\, laugh\, and danc
 e like nobody’s watching.\n\nAbout James\n\nPutting the fun in fitness f
 or over 30 years!\n\nI’ve been teaching and developing challenging class
 es that put the joy in enjoyment. Our bodies need to keep moving to mainta
 in balance\, strength\, flexibility\, and so much more. Why not make it fu
 n?\n\nThe more we move the better we feel. It’s proven that the only way
  to keep your body in tip top shape is to keep going. So why not have a fa
 bulous time while doing it? Come to class and see how your thoughts on mov
 ement will shift towards a happier more fulfilled experience at the gym.\n
 \nDATE AND TIME: Mondays\, 4:00 PM
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/classes/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
