DESCRIPTION:The anitici… PATION is over- After a sold-out run last Hallo
 ween Season THTR’s The Rocky Horror Show is back! Step into a world of t
 hrills\, chills\, and heels as THTR Productions presents this completely i
 mmersive production of **The Rocky Horror Show** (the live musical) !🫦\
 n\nFor one unforgettable weekend\, the California Theatre in Santa Rosa wi
 ll be transformed into Frank-N-Furter’s decadent world\, where the cult-
 classic rock musical unfolds all around you. This isn’t just a show—it
 ’s a fully interactive experience\, with Broadway\, Phoenix\, and Bay Ar
 ea performers bringing the outrageous story to life in every corner of the
  theatre.\n\nDr. Frank-N-Furter requests your presence. Costumes are highl
 y encouraged. Absolute pleasure is required.\n\n✨🪩👠✨\n\n**7:00: 
 Doors & Bar Open**\n\n**8:00-10:00: Showtime**
