 l ages -costumes encouraged! Seating Options: Indoor & outdoor seating ava
 ilable Kid- & Dog-Friendly: Families and well-behaved pups are welcome Add
 -On Tickets: Young Adult \\(11-20\\): $35 Child \\(Under 10\\): $5 Club Me
 mbers: Discount automatically applied at checkout Dress Code: Wine country
