DESCRIPTION:Join us for a wild night of karaoke and fun after the comedy s
 how every Friday - it's the ultimate party!\n\n Karaoke After Comedy – 
 Every Friday at 10PM!  Barrel Proof Lounge | Santa Rosa\n\nAfter the laug
