DESCRIPTION:OUTSIDE\, RAIN OR SHINE. Blue Note Napa Summer Sessions are he
 ld at The Meritage Resort and Spa\, located at 850 Bordeaux Way\, Napa 945
 58. The Sapphire Club Section offers reserved seating with a table and 2 c
 hairs\, sold in units of 2 only. Price is per seat\, not per table\, and i
 ncludes access to the Club Lounge with a cash bar and A/C. The Gold & Silv
